            "review_text": "Ritesh Ail\nVietnam839 contributions\n0\nBest Negronis in Nha Trang\nDec 2023 • Solo\nDon’t miss this place if you love cocktails! It’s made out of a lot of love & passion! Drinks are well balanced. My go to place for Negronis. \nYou can try their whisky smoked cocktails too. Limited food options and mostly bar food! I love their seafood spring rolls! Nice music and live band on selected days make this place even more wonderful!\nRead more\nWritten January 28, 2024",
