            "review_title": "Review at Mijack",
            "review_text": "Ignatius\nSingapore, Singapore228 contributions\n2\nGood vibes, good time\nSep 2023 • Friends\nThis is a fantastic spot to be explored, kick back and get lost in the music with the awesome cocktails by the bartender. The furnishing to the deco brings me back to the bars you find the states tucked away in a small town. Sort of like a hidden gem in Nha Trang. \n\nFor the owner if you read this, do add Howlin Wolf to your playlist, in particular the track Smokestack Lightnin ;-)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 4, 2023",
