            "review_text": "BonnieBackpacker\nGlasgow, United Kingdom60 contributions\n0\nBest bar in Nha Trang!!!\nMar 2023 • Couples\nWe had stayed in Nha Trang for 3 nights and couldn't find any good bars anywhere. We were losing hope until we stumbled upon MiJack bar on our last night. The place was amazing, great atmosphere, live music, delicious cocktails, great bar staff! Couldn't ask for more! Best bar in Nha Trang! Would definitely recommend! 😄\nWritten March 5, 2023",
