            "review_title": "Review at Mijack",
            "review_text": "JuicyJugs\nLondon, United Kingdom19 contributions\n0\nExcellent Cocktails & Wonderful Service\nOct 2020\nWe went for drinks and were immediately impressed with the setting. Good furniture and decor.\n\nWe had a variety of cocktails, incl a \"Rusty Nail', which is very strong. The staff noticed, and offered to take it away and be removed from the bill. This service is very caring and proactive. In many years of drinking, in many bars, I've never encountered service that special.\n\nBig thanks to the staff and mgmt. We will visiting again soon.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 5, 2020",
